  "_source": "UV-A1 (docs/eras/uv.md, machines 1 and 2, line 3). Real processes: the ANL/INL electrometallurgical pyroprocess (EBR-II; Li-LiCl-KCl molten salt, uranium collected on a cathode), MYRRHA and Rubbia's energy amplifier (a proton beam on a lead-bismuth spallation target drives a subcritical core).",
